# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF.
#
# `text=auto` alone stores LF but checks out CRLF on Windows, which then conflicts
# with Prettier's `endOfLine: "lf"` — every file reads as misformatted after a fresh
# clone. Pinning `eol=lf` keeps the working copy LF on every platform so the
# repository, Prettier, and CI all agree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch these.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.avif  binary
*.ico   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.webm  binary
*.pdf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary

# Generated — collapse in diffs and exclude from language stats.
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated
